#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:93
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "As the Participant conveys it."
msgstr "كما يوصله المشارك."

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:75
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Authorized WHO staff of the GDHCN Secretariat (Framework V, VI). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/GDHCNSecretariat."
msgstr "موظفو منظمة الصحة العالمية (WHO) المفوَّضون في أمانة GDHCN (الإطار V وVI). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/GDHCNSecretariat."

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:21
#. Diagram label
msgid "Business Owner Representative"
msgstr "ممثل مالك الأعمال"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:8
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Convey a Letter of Application through a secure channel. Framework IX."
msgstr "إيصال خطاب الطلب عبر قناة آمنة. الإطار IX."

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:18
#. Diagram label
msgid "Convey the Letter"
msgstr "إيصال الخطاب"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:30
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Delegate at the World Health Assembly or another WHO governing body meeting (Framework IX). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/OfficialDelegate."
msgstr "مندوب في جمعية الصحة العالمية أو في اجتماع آخر لأحد الأجهزة الرئاسية لمنظمة الصحة العالمية (WHO) (الإطار IX). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/OfficialDelegate."

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:39
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Framework IX names two."
msgstr "يحدّد الإطار IX قناتين."

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:50
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Framework IX: at the World Health Assembly or another WHO governing body meeting."
msgstr "الإطار IX: في جمعية الصحة العالمية أو في اجتماع آخر لأحد الأجهزة الرئاسية لمنظمة الصحة العالمية (WHO)."

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:104
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Framework IX: from the WHO Country Office, or the Permanent Mission in Geneva, to WHO Headquarters."
msgstr "الإطار IX: من المكتب القُطري لمنظمة الصحة العالمية (WHO)، أو من البعثة الدائمة في جنيف، إلى المقر الرئيسي للمنظمة."

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:35
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Framework IX: officially signed, one for each Trust Domain."
msgstr "الإطار IX: موقَّع رسمياً، خطاب واحد لكل نطاق ثقة."

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:19
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Framework IX: the Letter goes through a secure channel."
msgstr "الإطار IX: يمر الخطاب عبر قناة آمنة."

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:72
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Framework IX: the Letter reaches WHO Headquarters through a secure channel."
msgstr "الإطار IX: يصل الخطاب إلى المقر الرئيسي لمنظمة الصحة العالمية (WHO) عبر قناة آمنة."

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:45
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Framework IX: with the WHO Country Representative or authorized Secretariat staff. The Legal Representative may meet instead."
msgstr "الإطار IX: مع ممثل منظمة الصحة العالمية (WHO) القُطري أو موظفي الأمانة المفوَّضين. ويجوز للممثل القانوني الحضور بدلاً من ذلك."

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:99
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Framework IX."
msgstr "الإطار IX."

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:9
#. Diagram label
msgid "GDHCN Participant"
msgstr "مشارك في GDHCN"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:74
#. Diagram label
msgid "GDHCN Secretariat"
msgstr "أمانة GDHCN"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:12
#. Diagram label
msgid "GDHCN Secretariat (WHO)"
msgstr "أمانة GDHCN (WHO)"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:66
#. Diagram label
msgid "governing body"
msgstr "جهاز رئاسي"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:65
#. Diagram label
msgid "in country"
msgstr "داخل البلد"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:119
#. Diagram label
msgid "Letter at WHO Headquarters"
msgstr "الخطاب في مقر منظمة الصحة العالمية (WHO)"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:60
#. Diagram label
msgid "Letter conveyed"
msgstr "تم إيصال الخطاب"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:88
#. Diagram label
msgid "Letter expected"
msgstr "خطاب متوقَّع"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:34
#. Diagram label
msgid "Letter signed"
msgstr "تم توقيع الخطاب"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:108
#. Diagram label
msgid "Meet the delegate and check passport"
msgstr "مقابلة المندوب والتحقق من جواز السفر"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:98
#. Diagram label
msgid "Meet the representative and check passport"
msgstr "مقابلة الممثل والتحقق من جواز السفر"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:49
#. Diagram label
msgid "Meet WHO at a governing body with passport"
msgstr "مقابلة منظمة الصحة العالمية (WHO) في جهاز رئاسي مع جواز السفر"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:44
#. Diagram label
msgid "Meet WHO in country with passport"
msgstr "مقابلة منظمة الصحة العالمية (WHO) داخل البلد مع جواز السفر"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:83
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Meets the representative in country and sends the Letter by diplomatic pouch (Framework IX). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/WHOCountryRepresentative."
msgstr "يقابل الممثل داخل البلد ويرسل الخطاب بالحقيبة الدبلوماسية (الإطار IX). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/WHOCountryRepresentative."

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:29
#. Diagram label
msgid "Official Delegate"
msgstr "المندوب الرسمي"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:71
#. Diagram label
msgid "Receive the Letter"
msgstr "تلقّي الخطاب"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:103
#. Diagram label
msgid "Send the Letter by diplomatic pouch"
msgstr "إرسال الخطاب بالحقيبة الدبلوماسية"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:22
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Sends the Statement of Interest and the Letter of Application; may meet WHO in person (Framework IX). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/BusinessOwnerRepresentative."
msgstr "يرسل بيان الاهتمام وخطاب الطلب؛ ويجوز له مقابلة منظمة الصحة العالمية (WHO) شخصياً (الإطار IX). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/BusinessOwnerRepresentative."

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:10
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The Eligible GDHCN Participant (Framework VII)."
msgstr "المشارك المؤهَّل في GDHCN (الإطار VII)."

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:13
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The GDHCN Secretariat at WHO (Framework V, VI)."
msgstr "أمانة GDHCN في منظمة الصحة العالمية (WHO) (الإطار V وVI)."

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:38
#. Diagram label
msgid "Which secure channel?"
msgstr "أي قناة آمنة؟"

#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn:82
#. Diagram label
msgid "WHO Country Representative"
msgstr "ممثل منظمة الصحة العالمية (WHO) القُطري"
